WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.010
You're doing great, just a little further to go. A few things to keep in mind

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:04.480
tonight.

3
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.950
If you haven't had a bowel movement yet after starting your prep, don't panic —

4
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.080
it can take a

5
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.400
couple of hours to kick in. Keep drinking your clear liquids and stay patient.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.520
Also,

7
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.020
continue to avoid all solid foods and alcohol. And if you're on a split-dose

8
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.280
prep, your second

9
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:25.750
dose is coming up. There's a separate video walking you through that. Lastly,

10
00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.040
before you go to sleep,

11
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.490
confirm your arrival time with your driver for tomorrow. You're doing

12
00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.840
everything right.

13
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.760
Get some rest and we'll see you soon.
